{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249054-where-was-the-scarlet-empress","id":1249054,"title":"Where was the Scarlet Empress?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-26T21:18:03-07:00","id":1249054,"title":"Where was the Scarlet Empress?","content":"Where is the Scarlet Empress?<br /> Where was the Scarlet Empress?<br /> Where did the Scarlet Empress used to be when it was a mystery and -<br /> <br /> Ok, what I'm getting at is, what ideas did people have about where the Empress was back before it was defined in canon? There's things I like and don't like about her being kidnapped for the Reclamation, but I got into Exalted during 2e, I've seen heaps of discussion of that as canon and little else. I remember hearing this group talking about their game before I got into Exalted, and their idea was one of the things that drew my interest to the setting. They took turns storytelling, basically playing 3 games in the same setting - one was a group of Dragon-Blooded looking for the Empress, One was a group of Solars looking for the Empress, and one was a group of Abyssals looking for the Empress. They planned to play through a few stories of that and then decide which group would be the player characters in the final plot arc.<br /> <br /> I played in a game once where she returned, and her story was &quot;I was kidnapped by demons, but I freed myself and won these 50 totally-not-anathema servants from my captor in the process,&quot; giving the wedding guard a cover to act in Creation. That was kind of cool, but my understanding of the core qualities of the Scarlet Empress is that she's A) pretty badass and B) dedicated to protecting Creation (albeit ruthlessly.) So I find it hard to rationalise a plotline (for a game I'm running, I mean) where she's serving the Yozis willingly, or under their control. Maybe I could do something where she's pretending to co-operate while she prepares some stratagem to fight back, but that's a lot of time &amp; focus on her in a game that's not necessarily going to be centered on the Realm.<br /> <br /> Anyway, what other alternatives have people come up with?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}